  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterCasino2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "*Sigh*...\u2026"
  - "What\u2019s with the sighing? You wanted to escape this place more than anyone
    else. Why do you look so disappointed? "
  - "I\u2019m just thinking about everything waiting for us in the future. It\u2019s
    a little scary. I don\u2019t know the language, I don\u2019t know the laws there\u2026
    I\u2019ve never even been to Spain. "
  - "You know, I think there are plenty of English speakers there. Besides, Beast
    knows Spanish \u2014 judging by how much he swears in it. He\u2019ll definitely
    teach you a few words. "
  - "And work? I have no idea how they\u2019ll treat a Florida state diploma\u2026
    haha\u2026 maybe they won\u2019t even hire me as a pediatrician."
  - "First of all, diplomas are still recognized even if the countries aren\u2019t
    exactly friendly\u2026 and honestly, if they reject you, just tell them....."
  - "\u201C\xA1vete a la mierda!\u201D"
  - "And they\u2019ll hire you immediately."
  - EVE!
  - "Aren\u2019t you ashamed? You think Beast didn\u2019t teach me swear words over
    all those years of marriage?"
  - "Oh\u2026 well\u2026 still practical. And concise. Anyway, my point is that you\u2019re
    worrying too much about the safest part of this whole situation."
  - "First we need to actually get out of here\u2026 After that, I don\u2019t even
    know how I\u2019ll live myself. No education, no relatives. Guess I\u2019ll deal
    with it as it comes."
  - Eve? You do know nobody here hates you, right?
  - "Well, except Cyber, but he doesn\u2019t count."
  - "Hm? What\u2019s with the emotional nonsense all of a sudden?"
  - " I mean nobody\u2019s gonna throw you out in Spain. We\u2019ve gotten used to
    living together by now. So until you find housing, work, or a university, you
    can stay with us."
  - "You\u2019ll finally get to try my baking too. Consider it compensation for constantly
    being dragged into my family drama. Deal?"
  - "Ugh\u2026 I hate when people invade my personal space with weirdly sincere words
    like that. But\u2026 I\u2019ll think about it."
